:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Lost World Yuki (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Lost World Yuki''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Lost World Yuki
|image = E 339.png
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,222¢ - 8,776¢
}}

==Enemy==
Just like her [[Yuki (Enemy)|original world counterpart]], she supports high health and range with low damage.  Any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-floating Units]] can deal with her with ease.  In later stages she is supported well with enemy meatshields so long range and [[Wave Attack]] units are able to chip her down. However, she does have a guaranteed chance to [[Weaken|weaken]] [[Cat Units]] allowing her to take more hits than usual.

